Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in consortium with Eurocloud Solutions S.A., Lexia GmbH, and Greencompute S.R.L., proposes a comprehensive solution for the Region Lombardia tender. Our proposal integrates AI components, ensures high security and compliance standards, and prioritizes environmental sustainability. We will leverage technologies like Mistral 7B, LLaMA, Apache Kafka, Docker, Kubernetes, and Prometheus to deliver an efficient and scalable solution.

# 2. Understanding of Requirements
The client requires a solution that improves administrative efficiency and user experience while ensuring data sovereignty and regulatory compliance. The proposed system must integrate with existing systems of information, business software, electronic management of documents, and user directories. Moreover, it should meet specific security standards, including GDPR compliance, and prioritize environmental sustainability.

# 3. Proposed Solution
Our solution will employ Mistral 7B Instruct for AI tasks, given its strong language performance in French. We will utilize a combination of containerization technologies (Docker) and orchestration tools (Kubernetes) to ensure scalability and efficiency. For data integration, we will use Apache Kafka, ensuring seamless communication between different system components. Our technical architecture is designed to meet high performance levels, with response times compatible with daily use, not exceeding 2 seconds.

From a security perspective, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. has experience with GDPR compliance, having certifications such as ISO 27001, which are up-to-date. We will implement robust security measures, including encryption and anonymization of data (using tools like Microsoft Presidio), multi-factor authentication (MFA) with Time-Based One-Time Passwords (TOTP), and FIDO2 tokens. Our approach to security also includes regular penetration testing, at least annually, and after major releases.

Legally, we comply with all regulatory requirements, including GDPR, with a basis in Article 6(1)(e). We will provide DPIA support as needed and ensure that our solution respects data sovereignty, with data residency in the EU. Our contractual clauses will include liability and insurance, as well as intellectual property protection.

Financially, our proposal is within the budgetary capacity of the client, with a global budget of €3,000,000 for the project duration of 4 years. We aim to maintain service quality while optimizing costs, with a proposed infrastructure margin percentage of 12% and software license resale margin percentage of 8%. Our daily rates will be applicable for senior architects and project managers.

In terms of AI innovation, our proposal focuses on enhancing administrative efficiency and user experience through intelligent assistance tools. We leverage LLMs like Mistral 7B Instruct, which allows for self-hosting under the Apache 2.0 license. For explainability and trust techniques, we will use RAG grounding, SHAP, LIME, and chain of thought display.

Finally, regarding CSR and sustainability, our solution promotes digital sobriety, aiming to reduce energetic consumption through practices like model quantization (int8/int4), GPU energy consumption reduction by 40%, auto-scaling policies, and query result caching. We partner with green hosting providers (OVHcloud and Scaleway) that use 100% renewable energy.

# 4. Unaddressed Requirements
No specific requirements from the tender were left unaddressed in our proposal. However, certain details such as exact figures for some costs and a comprehensive list of all regulatory frameworks beyond GDPR and ISO 27001 were not provided due to the limitations of the extracted triplets.

# 5. Conclusion
Nexus Engineering S.r.l., along with its consortium partners, is committed to delivering a high-quality, compliant, and sustainable solution that meets the Region Lombardia's tender requirements. Our proposal integrates cutting-edge technologies, prioritizes security and data sovereignty, and aims to reduce environmental footprint. We believe our comprehensive approach makes us an ideal partner for this project.
